{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/572656-2-5-homebrew-lunar-wyld-shaping-sorceries","id":572656,"title":"[2.5 Homebrew] Lunar Wyld-Shaping Sorceries","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-29T08:19:05-07:00","id":572656,"title":"[2.5 Homebrew] Lunar Wyld-Shaping Sorceries","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\">You know who needs more cool Wyld-influencing Charms? Lunars. Lunars do. And so I present the following, designed with <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/56816-old-forum-repost-lunar-fan-errata\">this</a> fan errata in mind.</span><br /> <br /> <u><b>Silver Chaos Invocation</b></u><br /> <b>Cost:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> 10m; </span></span><b>Mins:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Intelligence 4, Essence 3; </span></span><b>Type:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Simple</span></span><br /> <b>Keywords:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Combo-OK, Obvious, Shaping</span></span><br /> <b>Duration:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Indefinite</span></span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Burgeoning Change Infliction or Harmony With Reality Technique</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">The mad realms beyond the borders of Creation give rise to impossible creatures and wonders, capable of laying Creation low, or raising it to new heights. How much more terrible must the protean chaos of Luna be when unleashed upon the world? The foes of the Stewards are unlucky enough to know. </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Upon activating this Charm, the Lunar selects one of her Intimacies, transforming it into a nexus of her raw protean power. Her chosen Intimacy congeals in her anima, creating an Obvious symbol of the Intimacy that floats prominently around the Lunar whilst the Charm persists \u2013 a Lunar who chose her Intimacy of Love for their Wood Aspect wife might have a coin of green jade limned in silver light circle her head for the duration.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Once the symbol is formed, the Lunar can use it to channel her Essence into blasts of raw Lunar puissance. These attacks can take almost any form the Lunar can imagine, so long as they fit within the themes of the Lunar Exalted and the Argent Madonna. She might extrude an essence-construct of her spirit shape from her anima, or cause her tattoos to extend out from her flesh in a nightmarish barrage of fractal silver shapes, or any number of other possibilities. Regardless of the form they take, these essence blasts are attacks with the following profile:</span></span><br /> <br /> <b>Silver Chaos Invocation:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Speed 5; Accuracy (Essence + Perception + Valour); Damage (Intelligence)L; Defence (Essence + Wits + Temperance); Rate (Essence, maximum 5); Range (Willpower + Essence); Tags O2</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">The nature of the Intimacy used as the attack's focus can change its properties. If a positive Intimacy is used, and its subject is present in the scene, then the Lunar increases the Defence of her Silver Chaos Invocation by her (Compassion), and may use it to take Defend Other actions on behalf of the Intimacy subject provided they are within range of the Steward's Silver Chaos Invocation. If a negative Intimacy is used, and its subject is present in the scene, then the Lunar reduces the Speed of her Silver Chaos Invocation by half her (Conviction), and adds the Piercing tag to its attacks.</span></span><br /> <br /> <u><b>Impossible Horizon Armoury</b></u><br /> <b>Cost:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> 2m (+1wp); </span></span><b>Mins:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Intelligence 4, Essence 3; </span></span><b>Type:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Supplemental</span></span><br /> <b>Keywords:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Combo-OK, Obvious, Shaping, Unearthly</span></span><br /> <b>Duration:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Instant</span></span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Silver Chaos Invocation</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">The Chosen of Luna are masters of their own impossible protean natures. How then might they command the realms beyond Creation that they Steward, realms that bend even to less mutable souls? This Charm can enhance any direct attack the Lunar makes using Silver Chaos Invocation whilst in an Unearthly Realm. Instead of unleashing her protean essence on her foe directly, the Lunar turns it on her surroundings and Shapes the natural phenomena of the environment into assaulting her target. This vastly broadens the array of descriptions and stunts she can utilise with her Silver Chaos Invocation. The Lunar can distribute a number of points between the attack's Accuracy, Damage and Defence equal to the Unearthly Realm's Degree of distance from Creation, but cannot improve any of them by more than her (Intelligence/2).</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">An Intelligence 5, Essence 4 repurchase of this Charm allows the Lunar to enhance her Unearthly Shaping attacks further, permitting her to pay a 1wp surcharge per attack to increase her Silver Chaos Invocation's Overwhelming value by the Unearthly Realm's Degree of distance from Creation, though this Charm cannot improve the Overwhelming value by a number greater than 4 until Essence 7+. Alternatively, she can pay a 1wp surcharge per attack to upgrade the damage of her Silver Chaos Invocation to aggravated against creatures native to an Unearthly Realm.</span></span><br /> <br /> <u><b>Vitiating Lunar Essence</b></u><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Cost:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> 5m, 1wp; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Mins:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Intelligence 4, Essence 3; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Type:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Supplemental</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Keywords:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Combo-OK, Obvious, Shaping, Stackable, Training</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Duration:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Prerequisite Charms:</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> Burgeoning Change Infliction, Impossible Horizon Armoury</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">A master of their own form and function, the Steward of Luna finds it simple to shape the clay of other beings \u2013 all the more so when they bear the brunt of her own metamorphic majesty. The Lunar may now pay a 5m, 1wp surcharge when attacking with Silver Chaos Invocation to apply the effects of Burgeoning Change Infliction at range, ignoring the limitations of the Touch keyword, permitting the Steward to mutate any she can touch with her eldritch essence.</span></span><br /> <br /> <u><b>Gaian Stewardship Methodology</b></u><br /> <b>Cost:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> -; </span></span><b>Mins:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Intelligence 5, Essence 4; </span></span><b>Type:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Permanent</span></span><br /> <b>Keywords:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Combo-OK, Obvious, Shaping</span></span><br /> <b>Duration:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Permanent</span></span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Impossible Horizon Armoury x2, For All Seasons</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Having learned to Steward the impossible nightmares beyond Creation, learning to tame the world they love becomes child's play for the Chosen of Luna. This Charm permanently upgrades Impossible Horizon Armoury. Whilst the Lunar has For All Seasons active, she treats natural environmental phenomena of Creation that her current activation of For All Seasons protects her from as natural phenomena of an Unearthly Realm with a Degree of distance from Creation equal to her ((Intelligence/2) + Compassion) for the purposes of utilising Impossible Horizon Armoury.</span></span><br /> <br /> <u><b>Illimitable Creation-Warding Witchery</b></u><br /> <b>Cost:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> - </span></span><b>Mins:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Intelligence 7, Essence 7; </span></span><b>Type:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Permanent</span></span><br /> <b>Keywords:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Combo-OK, Obvious, Shaping</span></span><br /> <b>Duration:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Permanent</span></span><br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> Gaian Stewardship Methodology</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Who is a greater force for change in Creation than the Lunar Exalted? The Lawgivers of Sol may take Creation to new heights, but stagnate once their visions of utter perfection are achieved. Such complacency ill-suits Creation's Stewards. This Charm permanently upgrades Gaian Stewardship Methodology. Whilst the Lunar is focusing her Silver Chaos Invocation through a positive Intimacy, she considers natural environmental phenomena of Creation that her current activation of For All Seasons protects her from to be a Degree of distance from Creation equal to her ((Compassion + number of positive Intimacies)/2) rather than ((Intelligence/2) + Compassion) Degrees. Conversely, whilst the Lunar is focusing her Silver Chaos Invocation through a negative Intimacy, she considers natural environmental phenomena of Creation that her current activation of For All Seasons protects her from to be a Degree of distance from Creation equal to her ((Conviction + number of negative Intimacies)/2) rather than ((Intelligence/2) + Compassion) Degrees.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5299,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5299-trivialrealities","user":"trivialrealities","date":". 06-29-2015, 11:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5299-trivialrealities","name":"trivialrealities","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5299_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}